   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A class at Kotoba Language holds a maximum of 8 adults. The school teaches English, Dutch, French, German, Mandarin and Japanese at Scheepmakerspassage 14 in Rotterdam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The free 45-minute placement interview comes first, in person or online, so each learner starts on the right CEFR level.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
